# Keeps the Heroku build context (repo root) lean: we only need backend/ code and
# the demo dataset. Everything else is excluded so the image build is fast and small.
# NOTE: this applies to the repo-root build context (Dockerfile.heroku) only; the
# docker-compose backend build uses backend/ as its context and is unaffected.
.git
.github
frontend
mimic-code-main
mimic-iv-docs
docs
hackathon-instructions
*.zip
*.md
.env
.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
backend/tests
backend/pytest.ini
